  "notes": "The verb form of ⟦{懐|なつ}かしい→懐かしい：02484_natsukashii⟧ (nostalgic). Expresses actively engaging with nostalgic feelings.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{懐|なつ}かしむ (to feel nostalgic about ~)\n- {懐|なつ}かしみ⟦ながら→ながら：10530_nagara⟧ (while reminiscing)\n- {懐|なつ}かしむよう⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ (as if nostalgic)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{懐|なつ}かしい→懐かしい：02484_natsukashii⟧: nostalgic (adjective)\n- ⟦{思|おも}い{出|で}→思い出：00331_omoide⟧: memory, recollection\n- ⟦{郷愁|きょうしゅう}→郷愁：06000_kyoushuu⟧: homesickness, nostalgia",
